#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:1 c83646bd81564dd08758b512ad09e173
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:3 381fe0566ecf43fc99cfb506e0bb5646
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:5 9f970ee1f4654c6ab8b1d0ac0bb41828
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:7 190aae41d2dc487493b3005bc6a91d42
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:9 dccf8d1d1d9f4f51b5998c921f8c63f6
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:11 a458d9631cc1457a9c4e9a0ba6599c4a
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:13 b5fc44ca8b624b71a065b98b8862ac0a
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:14 d9926e9d22ae41e69c34ce9791ffaa3b
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:15 447fde8d1b3b41888b81ed6138c7db09
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:16 bfbd9b883d7f48ceb354caf6a79e5795
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:17 bf41050d7df04107bb398debbcf8ffd8
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:19 c7e1afa794424da09afcf390bab49db2
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:21 7d8ca773167c41c196eea7f4dcac2c00
msgid ""
"Simulation, surrogate output, and numerical agreement do not constitute "
"physical detection or experimental validation."
msgstr ""
"La simulacion, una salida sustituta y la concordancia numerica no "
"constituyen deteccion fisica ni validacion experimental."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:23 545f449c650b49539c65cf9389a4aa08
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:25 dd7d789fca424268a56bdb5f1a31192b
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:27 ef72d43e05664e72adc934de05d2de82
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/operations.md:29 c4e3c56eccd344b0aef2282d7175681f
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `1.3.0a0` with status `public-"
"preview`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `1.3.0a0` con el estado `public-"
"preview`. Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version para "
"conocer los cambios."
